Nope.  DECnet provides a *lot* of support for RMS operations, but RMS is 
not VAX/VMS specific; it is also used on PDP-11s running RSX & RSTS.  
DECnet works as well as can be expected on other platforms as well -- 
obviously, you can't do RMS key lookups on a PC file.

