X-terminal; don't ask any more questions, just buy NCD or what so ever.
If You like the VT-1000 for some reason, think twice if You should not
(partly) give up the twisted-pair ETHERnet for thinwire coax. 

Moral; for those just planing to spend money into network is: Dont just
look at the price for cable and connector, lock for the price for an
entire system, and also put a value into the difference in flexibility.
